: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>当散户开始疯狂买科技时，20年科技股开始下跌，医药、食品开始大涨！</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;outline: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>就在下半年散户又开始追医药食品时，医药食品又开始下跌，变成了新能源、光伏、白酒大涨！</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;outline: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>老股民都知道，在2013-14年，文化传媒板块疯涨，热度完全不输现在的新能源！而当时白酒长期横盘，茅台股价几年不动。</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;outline: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>但现在完全颠倒过来了！白酒涨上天，而文化传媒成了跌得最惨的板块之一！</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;outline: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>5，A股就是这样，先把一种风格演绎到极致，然后物极必反。所以，新能源、光伏、白酒未来一定会下跌！而且很长时间都抬不起头来！</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;outline: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>你现在做短线没问题，毕竟现在风格还在成长股这块，但你一定要有这个心理准备，我就是来做短线投机的，切不可长拿！更不可补仓抗单！</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;outline: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>而白马股、银行保险券商等低估值也必会上涨。按历史走势来看，一般半年到1年风格就会完成一轮转变。</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;outline: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>如果你是长线价值投资者，手里拿的是低估值的好票，就不要追涨杀跌。岂不知，塞翁失马焉知非福？过几年再看，可能你才是最后的赢家！</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;outline: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>至于反转的时间和点位？来好好跟我学技术吧。以前A股大多数的风格转化，我都做到了。——顶底之王。</span></p></div>",
